  "medicationPalette": {
    "$note": "Which utility families become medication colors, and in what order. assignColor() hands out the first unused entry, so this is a greedy farthest-point walk in CIE Lab: the first medications a household adds look as different from each other as the palette allows. scripts/build-tokens.mjs re-checks contrast and separation on every build.",
